<title>USA: Enserch Exploration president resigns.</title>
<headline>Enserch Exploration president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enserch Exploration Inc said on Thursday that Gary Junco, 46, resigned as president and director of the company effective immediately, in order to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Frederick Addy, 64, who is serving as interim chairman and chief executive officer, would assume the additional role of president, the company said.</p>
<p>Enserch is a natural gas and oil exploration and production company with activities focused in Texas and the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
